```Title: Regasm or Regsvcs Loading an Assembly from a User-Writable Folder (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1218.009 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: cb726946-3b94-4ce3-91a4-45f54078d832```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Developers registering COM assemblies they built in a user folder; Installers registering assemblies from a temporary folder```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image IN ("*\\RegAsm.exe", "*\\RegSvcs.exe") CommandLine IN ("*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*", "*\\AppData\\Roaming\\*", "*\\Downloads\\*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
